  "components": [
    {
      "n": 0,
      "text": "etc.\n\n부산역에서 부산항 가는법 도보 연결 통로\n\n아영\n\n2026. 2. 21. 10:31\n\n 이웃추가\n본문 기타 기능",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://blogpfthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMjA5MDhfNzAg/MDAxNjYyNTk2MjEyMDk0.D12f1E0mLaqlZPZ4JCuU6xhrxFpFoVyi0dlYdbe8JyMg.C1iQEamwI1NH2y1SvjjjxlEhMwJv2cDNrwMckz7ggFcg.JPEG.ha_rang5/profileImage.jpg?type=s1",
          "full": "https://blogpfthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMjA5MDhfNzAg/MDAxNjYyNTk2MjEyMDk0.D12f1E0mLaqlZPZ4JCuU6xhrxFpFoVyi0dlYdbe8JyMg.C1iQEamwI1NH2y1SvjjjxlEhMwJv2cDNrwMckz7ggFcg.JPEG.ha_rang5/profileImage.jpg?type=s1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 1,
      "text": "부산에서 일본 후쿠오카, 오사카까지\n\n배를 타고 출국하는 분들은\n\n​\n\n부산역에서 부산항 국제여객터미널까지\n\n이동 방법이 궁금하실 텐데요\n\n​\n\n부산역과 부산항 국제여객터미널은\n\n연결 통로로 도보 이동이 가능합니다\n\n​\n\n제가 부산역에서 부산항까지 걸어가 본\n\n연결 통로 동선과 실제 소요 이동 시간을\n\n아래에서 정리했으니 참고해 주세요 :)\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "text": "부산역에서 출발(지하철 이용 시)",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfMjUg/MDAxNzcxNTkzNzMwNTA3.uXGBmbz1hilp_ULRb_ZubMQeIP_mDzr5oW6y0M-P2_Ig.R55WKfGd2QEuKdREcmsEcN73j3uKmZL6C-dJJSFkgn0g.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF3875438891.jpg?type=w800",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfMjUg/MDAxNzcxNTkzNzMwNTA3.uXGBmbz1hilp_ULRb_ZubMQeIP_mDzr5oW6y0M-P2_Ig.R55WKfGd2QEuKdREcmsEcN73j3uKmZL6C-dJJSFkgn0g.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF3875438891.jpg?type=w800"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n지하철 1호선을 이용해 부산역에 도착했다면\n\n이정표를 따라 부산역 방면으로 이동하세요\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "text": " ",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfNiAg/MDAxNzcxNTkzNzcxODA3.ml2EdCWgAx-j9ZgZtWuHDIkJrE_X0ccNdR6fgb3eBmwg.NY0WLdH6MYeNuTPjs0-FkoBY1IXOa07W9ucPYC1PAK0g.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF1783206228.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfNiAg/MDAxNzcxNTkzNzcxODA3.ml2EdCWgAx-j9ZgZtWuHDIkJrE_X0ccNdR6fgb3eBmwg.NY0WLdH6MYeNuTPjs0-FkoBY1IXOa07W9ucPYC1PAK0g.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF1783206228.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        },
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfNTYg/MDAxNzcxNTkzNzk3MTE1.uJNBuex4mJIb7-Sg87inBd14VusfVY6gU3Er9zn2ORQg.Uw4YkUTY06fAEVHjnse4B51fRbQtgQwUVxrJQbtNLHwg.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF334008988.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfNTYg/MDAxNzcxNTkzNzk3MTE1.uJNBuex4mJIb7-Sg87inBd14VusfVY6gU3Er9zn2ORQg.Uw4YkUTY06fAEVHjnse4B51fRbQtgQwUVxrJQbtNLHwg.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF334008988.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n에스컬레이터를 타고 올라가면\n\n부산역 광장으로 나오게 되고,\n\n정면에 보이는 건물 입구로 들어가면\n\n2층 대합실(맞이방)로 올라갈 수 있어요\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfNDMg/MDAxNzcxNTkzODk3MjM0.4d3i1o7asXA26vyRj5CbPATwq2bTA9WfN8BKfeYWT_8g.hdDLAA5OFSMo5i-QZ2lLM9W1jinYXlw81Y9zVNH-wJEg.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF3162178279.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfNDMg/MDAxNzcxNTkzODk3MjM0.4d3i1o7asXA26vyRj5CbPATwq2bTA9WfN8BKfeYWT_8g.hdDLAA5OFSMo5i-QZ2lLM9W1jinYXlw81Y9zVNH-wJEg.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF3162178279.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n부산역 대합실이 정말 넓어서\n\n부산항 국제여객터미널 안내 표지판이\n\n잘 안 보이더라고요\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfMTU5/MDAxNzcxNTk0MjkxNzg1.Q-N9VArV3l08D16Vuy4Ox2sLPZLFed-9Ha2N6-x4g0og.StI-fqNCBuF0Xh_ePqXaTxl8kLaosKsYcvA21-66C-Mg.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF3838817596.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfMTU5/MDAxNzcxNTk0MjkxNzg1.Q-N9VArV3l08D16Vuy4Ox2sLPZLFed-9Ha2N6-x4g0og.StI-fqNCBuF0Xh_ePqXaTxl8kLaosKsYcvA21-66C-Mg.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF3838817596.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n2층 맞이방을 안내하는 큰 표지판이\n\n대합실 중앙에 있는데요\n\n​\n\n아래쪽에 부산항 국제여객터미널 방면\n\n50m 직진 표시가 보일 거예요\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "text": " ",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfMTg2/MDAxNzcxNTk0MzY0MzUw.vwIpcgyUdHk9Tz2dP5qYZDHICMclw-TA7SqxORkTj10g.A0FF3TNnx-n0HvjbBUD-Udd0wc74YDJPNAYxII1YcQ8g.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF2352583861.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfMTg2/MDAxNzcxNTk0MzY0MzUw.vwIpcgyUdHk9Tz2dP5qYZDHICMclw-TA7SqxORkTj10g.A0FF3TNnx-n0HvjbBUD-Udd0wc74YDJPNAYxII1YcQ8g.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF2352583861.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        },
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfNTIg/MDAxNzcxNTk0NDExODcz.ThCq1_6ndtJ7YH7M4gi9RAkqqlbQoL0WfVCBBVyL46kg.08ptJvWLWYJkxL369AX29XJBvjeqjAA1OJFqWSH-WoAg.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF213130976.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfNTIg/MDAxNzcxNTk0NDExODcz.ThCq1_6ndtJ7YH7M4gi9RAkqqlbQoL0WfVCBBVyL46kg.08ptJvWLWYJkxL369AX29XJBvjeqjAA1OJFqWSH-WoAg.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF213130976.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n그 방향으로 계속 직진하다 보면 9번 출구가 보이고,\n\n9번 출구로 나가면 바로 연결 통로가 시작돼요\n\n​\n\n▶ 여기까지가 부산역 내부 동선입니다!\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "text": "부산역 → 부산항 연결 통로 동선",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTlfMTA0/MDAxNzcxNDYzNTMzOTU0.22S9-zwPYF6haNXTd0QBr-iLZDYWM9gPAZXQ74d4JUYg.2p7OLTKwKdtZLa0byB7cUluOHWKHyK-Gge0RY3LYqkgg.JPEG/P20260215_174120801_73F70055-0D6B-4001-A658-785985DCCBAA.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTlfMTA0/MDAxNzcxNDYzNTMzOTU0.22S9-zwPYF6haNXTd0QBr-iLZDYWM9gPAZXQ74d4JUYg.2p7OLTKwKdtZLa0byB7cUluOHWKHyK-Gge0RY3LYqkgg.JPEG/P20260215_174120801_73F70055-0D6B-4001-A658-785985DCCBAA.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n연결 통로에는 무빙워크가 설치되어 있어\n\n캐리어를 끌고 이동하기 수월한 편이에요\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjFfMTA3/MDAxNzcxNjM3NDczODg0._rCuZY6C4PxgYFgxu_JZOYNfFtuT9dlaDgtVpOm8LPwg.FdIAJ-o8rHbuBYkYIDDiE0aNQD8-LiZmv0rQiH0b8Mog.JPEG/IMG%EF%BC%BF9549.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjFfMTA3/MDAxNzcxNjM3NDczODg0._rCuZY6C4PxgYFgxu_JZOYNfFtuT9dlaDgtVpOm8LPwg.FdIAJ-o8rHbuBYkYIDDiE0aNQD8-LiZmv0rQiH0b8Mog.JPEG/IMG%EF%BC%BF9549.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n중간중간 이정표가 잘 되어 있고\n\n길이 단순해서 헤맬 가능성이 낮고\n\n비 오는 날에도 실내 이동도 가능하더라고요\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 18,
      "text": "",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 19,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTlfNTUg/MDAxNzcxNDYzNTI2ODUz.8Xu0UEeMxaVTBYfwR6D97Pi5bvOB0jxakB818zwwq3wg.VA3eIQAYiOgBjTfXPNq9t65O8JdOsPm0pphCDQ1yH84g.JPEG/P20260215_174345051_107C9517-3908-4A25-98E0-F69D81CBB3C1.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTlfNTUg/MDAxNzcxNDYzNTI2ODUz.8Xu0UEeMxaVTBYfwR6D97Pi5bvOB0jxakB818zwwq3wg.VA3eIQAYiOgBjTfXPNq9t65O8JdOsPm0pphCDQ1yH84g.JPEG/P20260215_174345051_107C9517-3908-4A25-98E0-F69D81CBB3C1.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 20,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n실제로 걸어보니\n\n부산역 대합실에서 부산항까지\n\n빠른 걸음으로 10분 정도 소요됐는데요\n\n​\n\n부모님과 같이 이동하거나\n\n캐리어가 있다면 15-20분 정도로\n\n시간을 여유 있게 가지는 게 안전할 거예요 *^^*\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 21,
      "text": "부산항 국제여객터미널 도착",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 22,
      "text": " ",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTlfNTYg/MDAxNzcxNDYzNDk4OTkw.hIYWqMEvb3WqLIXHmOF1cvrptk3WtG--Z-M6gS3_j70g.xlgH9Kuu27mRQncm8wwwzpYOuTdMqqTd6C41SOGwfpUg.JPEG/P20260215_174726803_B681F1C2-BA30-47B3-9B49-96BF2957523D.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTlfNTYg/MDAxNzcxNDYzNDk4OTkw.hIYWqMEvb3WqLIXHmOF1cvrptk3WtG--Z-M6gS3_j70g.xlgH9Kuu27mRQncm8wwwzpYOuTdMqqTd6C41SOGwfpUg.JPEG/P20260215_174726803_B681F1C2-BA30-47B3-9B49-96BF2957523D.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        },
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTlfMjUg/MDAxNzcxNDYzNTAyNTIz.B_4beMeNpbDfFWpAapgwnSSDnGdxvdx492AOFbVtcrEg.y0Yl5cnrTTJnfceD4UnXQOuhcQho076T-KNgRWdhBLYg.JPEG/P20260215_174735403_2809B091-60EA-4FCE-B1FA-AC14789F4C9A.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTlfMjUg/MDAxNzcxNDYzNTAyNTIz.B_4beMeNpbDfFWpAapgwnSSDnGdxvdx492AOFbVtcrEg.y0Yl5cnrTTJnfceD4UnXQOuhcQho076T-KNgRWdhBLYg.JPEG/P20260215_174735403_2809B091-60EA-4FCE-B1FA-AC14789F4C9A.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 23,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n끝날 듯 끝나지 않던 연결 통로 끝엔\n\n부산항 국제여객터미널 건물이 있어요\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 24,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfMTM2/MDAxNzcxNTk0NTIxMTEy.nZ8jlb17fX3RcuRNE6iUYmk-8lnwP2YBs2iMtBZ92k0g.PUx-XrRaLyTy2DJpLHVSHqIlHEC7EUP4-5SYjmd1kykg.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF3215783542.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMjBfMTM2/MDAxNzcxNTk0NTIxMTEy.nZ8jlb17fX3RcuRNE6iUYmk-8lnwP2YBs2iMtBZ92k0g.PUx-XrRaLyTy2DJpLHVSHqIlHEC7EUP4-5SYjmd1kykg.JPEG/output%EF%BC%BF3215783542.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 25,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n건물 안으로 들어가면 2층 입국장으로 연결되고,\n\n일본행 배를 타는 경우 3층 출국장으로 올라가야 합니다\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 26,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTlfMjE1/MDAxNzcxNDYzNTMyNTg4.KFWY2-4EHCTWSzY-oPgtY2zEQ--UAPOLr0n51UKjqygg.pyjBx9sCIe7hqvkkMIqzx29Kk6kFokFNX8qBO4ZmLOkg.JPEG/P20260215_174924797_BB74DD83-166D-4927-9235-687A144E47AC.jpg?type=w80_blur",
